      <div class="insight-banner">
        <strong>✧ &nbsp; Market insight</strong>
        <p>
          Compensation rises with specialization: AI Engineer/Analyst roles had the highest median salary, followed by Data Scientists and Data Analysts. Hiring was concentrated in Finance &amp; Insurance and Professional &amp; Technical Services, while mid-level roles represented the largest experience group. Hybrid work dominated every experience level, with remote work consistently more common than onsite-only arrangements.
